{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1461.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"90c1573b5862b0bb7e5a565b11e562ea1d7f90930b2971be34304e91044b6938","ja":"……す、すごい男の子だね。今の演技、\n本当に可奈の友達が告白する男子のマネしているの？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1461.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"c38658e5ea44a6079355444fc640427569084a00052aa2d29ebf2e588922f788","ja":"はい。琴葉さんが演じた湊さんを、\nもっとキザでナルシストにした感じの人なんです。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1461.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"fcbd0b9c7ce7ddc1ae4995b5b4fc8db3f9571035c5fa19e51ca899bb2b96d79d","ja":"今のセリフも、別の子に告白されてた時に、\nそう答えているのを見たことがあって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1461.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"df541e746e6a40e233cc2fc344c4a4dcb464279f94f3f1091423a839ee3b88b0","ja":"ねえ、カナ……友達の話だけど、\nそんな人に告白しちゃっていいノ……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1461.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"dc9fbe50e8b39adb85c704d3546fb274f2df315c8609500d66d98a1bbf641946","ja":"うう……やっぱり、不安ですよね。\n私も、そう思ったんですけど……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1461.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"fba38d467e1ff69a64a64169ea0dea96bb65677e12fa3d9831db627abcc706b4","ja":"でも、友達はその人のことすごく好きみたいで、\n一生懸命な姿を見てると、言い出しにくくって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
